          "test_procedure": "1. Locate the EIP-7702 authorization processing code and identify where nonce increment occurs.\n2. Verify that nonce increment happens atomically with authorization application.\n3. Record the authorizer's nonce before submitting an EIP-7702 transaction.\n4. Submit a valid EIP-7702 authorization and verify the transaction succeeds.\n5. Check that post(account.nonce) == pre(account.nonce) + 1 for the authorizer.\n6. Test with multiple authorizations in a single transaction targeting the same authorizer.\n7. Verify nonce increment occurs for each successful authorization in sequence.",
          "bug_class": "State Consistency",
          "risk_category": "Tampering",
          "notes": "Source: PROP-W6B15-6, Trust Boundary: tb-006, Source Assumption: asm-006, Threat: stride-003"
